      <description>Son Del North - New York (Primary)
📍 177 Orchard St
📞 (718) 521-2447
🔗 https://www.theinfatuation.com/new-york/reviews/son-del-north
⭐ Signature Items:
• Carne Asada: The standout option with meaty flavor from salsa-roja covered steak and grilled onions. The Infatuation's top pick.
• Camaron Ranchero: Shrimp in a heavy ranchero sauce with smoky, fire-roasted tomato flavor that stands out with the lighter protein
• Pollo Asado: Chicken with salsa verde alongside strips of poblano peppers in a creamy sauce. Decent but flavors don't pop as much as the steak and shrimp
🔥 Popular Items:
• Frijol Con Queso: Bean and cheese burrito with a 20:80 bean-to-cheese ratio. Skip unless you want a giant cheese roll in a really good tortilla.
• Cauliflower Chorizo Con Papas: Vegan option with peppery chorizo flavor, though cauliflower could be crispier
• Totopos &amp; Salsa: Chips and salsa, featuring their roasted green chili sauce</description>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>-73.9885461,40.7218102,0</coordinates>
      </Point>
